    "runners": 8,
    "type": "Jumps",
    "race_overview": "There should be more to come from A LITTLE SOMETHING after she unseated at the last at Stratford last time when looking on course for a third successive win over fences. She is preferred to Holy Legend who scored at Fontwell in May and was second over C&D last month. Greer Hill scored on his chase debut here last month but needs to put a poor run here behind him last time, while Traveling Soldier has something to prove but represents a respected trainer-jockey combination. [Andrew Bladen]"
   }
