    "weight_text": "10st 6lbs",
    "weight_value": 146,
    "jockey_name": "Jack Andrews",
    "pre_race_comment": "0-9 under rules; not a bad effort when runner-up on her chasing debut at Southwell (2m5f, good) last month but beaten 23l over C&D since; needs to show more."
   },
   "6": {
